  "message": "Hey there! I’m Toyota, the friendly front‑desk for our finance analysis team. I can point you to the right specialist when you need it. Here’s a quick rundown of what each of our agents does:\n\n- **mapper_cash** – finds patterns in cash‑purchase transactions (method = CASH)  \n- **mapper_card** – analyzes card‑swipe spending (method = CARD)  \n- **mapper_bank** – tracks ACH/online‑transfer payments, often recurring bills (method = BANK)  \n- **mapper_other** – handles paper checks and anything that doesn’t fit the other three (method = OTHER)  \n- **synthesizer** – merges the four mapper reports, flags missed bills, amount anomalies, and spots new recurring candidates  \n- **receipt_scanner** – hunts for orphaned or mislabeled receipt images and cross‑checks them against the expense database  \n- **expense_reconciler** – finds expense rows without matching receipts, ignoring known receipt‑less transactions  \n- **progress_check** – gives you a read‑only status of what reports already exist and how fresh they are (no new analysis runs)\n\nIf you’d like any of those agents to run a fresh analysis—say, “check for missed bills” or “scan the receipts”—just let me know and I’ll route the request. Otherwise I’m happy to answer questions about what we do, explain past results, or help with anything else you need. How can I assist you today?",
